    "overview": "3-bit up-counter with synchronous enable. When a=1 the counter holds its value; when a=0 the counter increments by 1 (mod 8) on each rising clock edge. Output q updates one cycle after the sampled edge.",
    "rules": [
      "On each rising edge of clk: if a==1, q holds its current value; if a==0, q <= (q + 1) mod 8.",
